{"ticker":"MRVL","updated":"2026-10-30T22:59:49Z","profile":{"longName":"Marvell Technology, Inc.","shortName":"Marvell Technology, Inc.","sector":"Technology","industry":"Semiconductors","country":"United States","website":"https://www.marvell.com","fullTimeEmployees":7480,"marketCap":176505585664,"trailingPE":64.60526,"forwardPE":26.79992,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":18.677246,"pegRatio":0.54,"targetMeanPrice":340.56198,"targetHighPrice":450.0,"targetLowPrice":229.95,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":44,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":0.365,"earningsGrowth":0.5,"grossMargins":0.52216,"operatingMargins":0.16679001,"profitMargins":0.27934998,"totalRevenue":9450300416,"beta":2.26,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":329.88,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":70.69,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.11},"summary":"Marvell Technology, Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides data infrastructure semiconductor solutions and spanning the data center core to network edge in the United States, Argentina, China, India, Israel, Japan, Singapore, South Korea, Taiwan, Vietnam, and internationally. The company develops and scales system-on-a-chip architectures, integrating analog, mixed-signal, and digital signal processing functionality. It offers a portfolio of ethernet solutions, including spanning controllers, network adapters, physical transceivers, and switches; single or multiple core processors; and custom application specific integrated circuits, interconnects, fibre channel adapters, and processors. The company also provides interconnect products, including pulse amplitude modulation, coherent and coherent-lite digital signal processors (DSPs), laser drivers, trans-impedance amplifiers, silicon photonics, co-packaged optics, linear pluggable optics chipsets, data center interconnect, active electrical cable DSPs and peripheral component interconnect express retimer solutions; fibre channel products comprising host bus adapters and controllers for server and storage system connectivity; storage controllers for hard disk drives and solid-state-drives; host system interfaces, including serial advanced technology attachment and serial attached SCSI, peripheral component interconnect exp","summary_zh":"Marvell Technology, Inc. 及其子公司在美國、阿根廷、中國、印度、以色列、日本、新加坡、韓國、台灣、越南和國際上提供資料基礎設施半導體解決方案，涵蓋資料中心核心到網路邊緣。該公司開發並擴展系統單晶片架構，整合類比、混合訊號和數位訊號處理功能。它提供了一系列乙太網路解決方案，包括跨接控制器、網路適配器、實體收發器和交換器；單核心或多核心處理器；以及客製化專用積體電路、互連、光纖通道適配器和處理器。該公司還提供互連產品，包括脈衝幅度調變、相干和相干精簡版數位訊號處理器（DSP）、雷射驅動器、互連抗放大器、矽光子、共封裝光學元件、線性可插拔光學晶片組、資料中心互連、主動電纜DSP和周邊組件互連快速重定時器解決方案；光纖通道產品，包括用於伺服器和儲存系統連接的主機匯流排適配器和控制器；硬碟和固態驅動器的儲存控制器；主機系統接口，包括串行高級技術附件和串行連接SCSI、外圍組件互連擴展","sector_zh":"科技","industry_zh":"半導體","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":61.96,"h":64.66,"l":61.81,"c":64.6,"v":36275600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":64.05,"h":64.52,"l":61.72,"c":62.31,"v":34297300},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":62.14,"h":64.53,"l":61.44,"c":64.1,"v":27726400},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":63.98,"h":64.59,"l":62.47,"c":63.33,"v":25793100},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":63.62,"h":66.13,"l":63.07,"c":66.0,"v":24466600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":65.86,"h":67.44,"l":65.19,"c":66.84,"v":17226000},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":67.92,"h":68.52,"l":66.68,"c":67.1,"v":23751400},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":67.0,"h":68.2,"l":66.36,"c":66.59,"v":13912400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":67.55,"h":67.75,"l":66.14,"c":67.35,"v":14868600},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":67.45,"h":68.11,"l":66.33,"c":67.43,"v":17340800},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":67.84,"h":69.18,"l":67.36,"c":68.86,"v":15931000},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":68.86,"h":72.41,"l":68.36,"c":70.98,"v":29593100},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":72.75,"h":75.0,"l":72.49,"c":74.23,"v":28894800},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":74.75,"h":75.37,"l":73.32,"c":74.26,"v":31788100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":73.35,"h":75.93,"l":73.35,"c":75.53,"v":20037700},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":75.39,"h":76.35,"l":74.02,"c":74.62,"v":21403700},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":76.96,"h":81.72,"l":75.07,"c":80.09,"v":50429500},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":78.11,"h":84.46,"l":76.32,"c":83.81,"v":43286000},{"t"