c-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiyAFBVV95cUxQajZFWTgtUGlOR25Zam9mMkxmZFpLcVZWYUlXeU1FUmoyMklWMUVERUFSbzdfY2stbERHVDVnMW50M1dZVGNxWmE3R2JEd3VyU1YxZVdBbkZaVi1ZaWx1a0JTV0kxenNJNXVaeFFsOG15S0lsbzRiUTZRWFUtSE9telYxeHhSV1ZzVkxpdERzUFdaa0x6SW9JaXFKcnNNd3o5b2tsNDU4QUd6aG5EYWNIczVsa3ZIOENZeVRpTUI0MW5ZN3dkU1IzTA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Marvell Technology 股票權衡 Lumentum 出價與稀釋風險 - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Marvell Technology stock weighs all-share Lumentum talks - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPb2tHaEd1QWlyV1YyekNrcGMzQmdqN0ZhU1hsTU5NT091c2cxWjNfQm1FRHFEREZiU1RET1FlbW85a3FVdll6YXhhOE9LNXV2aDA1MGNRZmU2Ym5HbFJvXzcybTI3Y2xuc3VFb1cxeGJqTXhEOHpZUmVRbXZ1LWJLMlV3SFZSVXVjbG1hSEpycEFMWDRhRTFpdFR0cnRhN1E0V3MzVjdRSTRPZGNxbHdTNExtRFNXOHhva19v?oc=5","date":"2026-10-30","zh":"Marvell 科技股票影響 Lumentum 的全股談判 - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Marvell Technology in advanced talks to buy optics maker Lumentum, source says","src":"Reuters","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipgFBVV95cUxNR2xWTFdaYmFQNV9rVnZVcmltcTJqWGoyUVBzUlVPcDJaZm4xLXVCMmt4Szk2YnF1VjVXUEdjV0xDbGxRdjc2WjBzQjVnTnU0SWpSWkJmdlg0WS15eGNhc09ZNWpHUVc2Znk0aE9haUpPVlZOeUdqNl9CSzdHaUtITm1BTWh1d0tKTWtCYWM1M183ekZkSGptb3B4MUthVzhiM1hUOEhR?oc=5","date":"2026-10-29","zh":""}],"themes":[{"name":"訂單/合約","count":7},{"name":"AI 人工智慧","count":2}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-11","period":"2026-01-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1835632/000183563226000011/mrvl-20260131.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Marvell Technology, Inc., together with its consolidated subsidiaries (\"Marvell,\" \"MTI,\" the \"Company,\" \"we,\" or \"us\") is a leading supplier of data infrastructure semiconductor solutions, spanning the data center core to network edge. We are a fabless supplier of high-performance semiconductor products with core strengths in developing and scaling complex System-on-a-Chip architectures, integrating analog, mixed-signal and digital signal processing functionality. Leveraging leading intellectual property and deep system-level expertise, as well as highly innovative security firmware, our solutions are empowering the data economy and enabling the data center and communications and other end markets.","zh":"Marvell Technology, Inc. 及其合併子公司（「Marvell」、「MTI」、「本公司」、「我們」或「我們」）是資料基礎設施半導體解決方案的領先供應商，涵蓋資料中心核心到網路邊緣。我們是高性能半導體產品的無晶圓廠供應商，其核心優勢在於開發和擴展複雜的系統單晶片架構，整合類比、混合訊號和數位訊號處理功能。憑藉領先的智慧財產權和深厚的系統級專業知識以及高度創新的安全固件，我們的解決方案正在為資料經濟提供支持，並為資料中心、通訊和其他終端市場提供支援。"},{"en":"We currently are incorporated in Delaware, United States. Our corporate headquarters is 1000 N. West Street, Suite 1200 Wilmington, Delaware 19801, and our telephone number is (302) 295-4840. We also have operations in many countries, including Argentina, China, India, Israel, Japan, Singapore, South Korea, Taiwan and Vietnam. Our fiscal year ends on the Saturday nearest January 31.","zh":"我們目前在美國特拉華州註冊成立。我們的公司總部位於 1000 N. West Street, Suite 1200 Wilmington, Delaware 19801，電話號碼為 (302) 295-4840。我們也在許多國家/地區開展業務，包括阿根廷、中國、印度、以色列、日本、新加坡、韓國、台灣和越南。我們的財政年度於 1 月 31 日最近的星期六結束。"},{"en":"On August 14, 2025, we completed the sale of our automotive ethernet business to Infineon Technologies AG for $2.5 billion in cash. In connection with the transaction, during the third quarter of fiscal 2026, we recorded a pre-tax gain on sale of $1.8 billion.","zh":"2025 年 8 月 14 日，我們以 25 億美元現金完成將汽車乙太網路業務出售給英飛凌科技股份公司。與此交易相關的是，在 2026 財年第三季度，我們實現了 18 億美元的稅前銷售收益。"}],"markets":[{"en":"Our product solutions serve two end markets: (i) data center and (ii) communications and other. These markets and their corresponding customer products and applications are noted in the table below:","zh":"我們的產品解決方案服務於兩個終端市場：(i) 資料中心和 (ii) 通訊及其他。這些市場及其相應的客戶產品和應用如下表所示："},{"en":"* These customer products and applications were divested as part of the automotive ethernet business sale on August 14, 2025.","zh":"* 這些客戶產品和應用程式於 2025 年 8 月 14 日作為汽車乙太網路業務出售的一部分被剝離。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Our target customers are original equipment manufacturers (\"OEMs\") and original design manufacturers, both of which design and manufacture end market devices, and distributors for these products. We seek to strategically align our sales force along key customer lines in order to offer fully integrated platforms to our customers. In this way, we believe we can more effectively offer a broader set of content into our key customers' end products, without having multiple product groups separately engage the same customer. We seek to complement and support our direct sales force with manufacturers' representatives for our products in North America. In addition, we have contracted with distributors who support our sales and marketing activities in the United States, Europe and Asia. We also use third-party logistics providers who maintain warehouses in close proximity to our customers' facilit","zh":"我們的目標客戶是設計和製造終端市場設備的原始設備製造商（“OEM”）和原始設計製造商以及這些產品的經銷商。我們尋求根據關鍵客戶線策略性地調整我們的銷售隊伍，以便為我們的客戶提供完全整合的平台。透過這種方式，我們相信我們可以更有效地為關鍵客戶的最終產品提供更廣泛的內容，而無需多個產品組分別吸引同一客戶。我們尋求北美產品製造商代表來補充和支持我們的直銷隊伍。此外，我們還與支持我們在美國、歐洲和亞洲的銷售和行銷活動的經銷商簽訂了合約。我們也使用第三方物流供應商，他們的倉庫靠近我們客戶的設施"}],"competition":[{"en":"The markets for our products are intensely competitive, and are characterized by rapid technological change, evolving industry standards, frequent new product introductions and pricing pressures. Competition has intensified as a result of the increasing demand for higher levels of performance, integration and smaller process geometries. We expect competition to further intensify as current competitors strengthen the depth and breadth of their product offerings, either through in-house development or by acquiring existing technology. In addition, some of our customers have chosen to develop certain semiconductor products internally and this trend may continue to proliferate. We believe that our ability to compete successfully in the rapidly evolving markets for our products depends on multiple factors, including, but not limited to:","zh":"我們產品的市場競爭激烈，其特徵是技術變革迅速、行業標準不斷變化、新產品頻繁推出和定價壓力。由於對更高水準的性能、整合度和更小的製程幾何尺寸的需求不斷增加，競爭加劇。我們預計，隨著當前競爭對手透過內部開發或收購現有技術來加強其產品供應的深度和廣度，競爭將進一步加劇。此外，我們的一些客戶選擇內部開發某些半導體產品，這種趨勢可能會繼續擴散。我們相信，我們的產品在快速發展的市場中成功競爭的能力取決於多種因素，包括但不限於："},{"en":"the development execution, timing and success of enhanced and new product introductions by us, our customers and our competitors;","zh":"我們、我們的客戶和我們的競爭對手推出增強型產品和新產品的開發執行、時機和成功；"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"Data Center","val":6100300000,"zh":"資料中心"},{"name":"Communications & Other","val":2094300000.0000002,"zh":"通訊及其他"}],"total":8194600000},"geo":{"end":"2026-01-31","items":[{"name":"CN","val":2969900000,"zh":"中國"},{"name":"Other Countries","val":2393300000,"zh":"其他國家"},{"name":"TW","val":1657300000,"zh":"台灣"},{"name":"US","val":1174100000,"zh":"美國"}],"total":8194600000}},"peers":["AVGO","MU","SNDK","TSM","ARM"]}}